WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
No, not old

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,400
But we are over 30 years old there

3
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:05,000
Many people are already old enough to be grandparents. What about you?

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
I'm twenty-eight

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Then you can be a grandpa, right?

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,800
My father has arranged a marriage for me

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:11,800
I was going to marry him when I was eighteen

8
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:12,800
It's a pity that he died

9
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,800
I'm sorry, Xiao Zhengbei

10
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,000
I don't know about this

11
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000
I'm really sorry

12
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,600
That's all I said, don't take it to heart

13
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,600
It has nothing to do with you

14
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:19,600
I avenged him

15
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:21,200
Then sit here for a while

16
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,800
My parents should be here soon too

17
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,200
The food will be ready soon

18
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:26,670
I'll go up and find them

19
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,670
Don't go

20
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:29,470
Those people are not good people.

21
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,470
Or just a little yellow hair

22
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:31,670
Or a little Thai girl

23
00:00:31,670 --> 00:00:32,670
Mix in society every day

24
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:34,670
I'm too lazy to talk to them. It's okay.

25
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,070
I'll go talk to them

26
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:40,060
Who is making noise at the door?

27
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:42,480
Who am I?

28
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,680
What do you want to do? You guys are too noisy. Don't be so noisy.

29
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:48,280
I've already disturbed the people downstairs. Who am I to scare? Turn it off and don't jump again.

30
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,480
None of your business

31
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:50,480
Are you looking for a fight?

32
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:51,680
That's not how it works

33
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,680
You spend too much money

34
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:54,480
It's not usable. Come and take a look.

35
00:00:54,480 --> 00:00:55,680
There's a fool here

36
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:57,480
He also said that I was using the knife incorrectly and taught me some lessons.

37
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:59,080
It really made me laugh to death
